          <groundspeak:finder id="7364793">NurseB33</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP488 Esplanade Arts and Heritage Center&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Happy International Geocaching Day &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Geo-Mom and I are in town for SAW XII (and general geocaching) and this time I came organized with a list of Brass Caps in the area &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_approve.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;! Following the S7: Flash Mob (super fun), I headed downtown for the Wherigo cache and to grab some Brass Caps. This one was easy to spot but I let out a huge &quot;ewwww.....&quot; as I removed the cover. Check out the photo and you'll see why! Details have been sent to the C.O. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for another great Brass Cap, OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
